	UpgradeDescription(1)="<font color=\"#CC0000\">Deathless Fury:</font> <font color=\"#FFFFFF\">+75%</font> <font color=\"#66CCFF\">weapon speed</font> during <font color=\"#9966FF\">Zed Time</font>. <font color=\"#FFFFFF\">+1.5s</font> <font color=\"#FFAA00\">Zed Time extension</font> on trigger kills."

